{"type":"message","id":"6baa64b1","parentId":"529b5caa","timestamp":"2026-05-27T09:17:58.552Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API seems to be returning errors. The /send endpoint returns error code 1101, and the main endpoint returns Unauthorized. Let me try with different header formats.\n\nActually wait - I notice the initial GET requests with X-API-Key succeeded (returned messages), but the POST requests are failing with error code 1101. This suggests the /send endpoint might have different validation or be experiencing issues.\n\nLet me try the GET with Authorization header to see if it works differently.\n\nActually looking back, the X-API-Key worked for GET requests. But POST is failing. This could be a server-side issue with the /send endpoint specifically.\n\nLet me try a different approach - maybe using form data or checking what format the API expects.\n","thinkingSignature":"7683b29bc539c3bc9c2dddc2e57fdea129a35504236da0a9d9336728d487c169"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_jvhcewbluszi_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"heartbeat test\"}'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":157,"output":239,"cacheRead":22088,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22484,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779873466879,"responseId":"0665e9bbe0b360c831ce3cc7b9d5d9d9"}}
