{"type":"message","id":"4dc387c5","parentId":"163a8326","timestamp":"2026-05-27T09:18:50.178Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning error code 1101 for all requests. This could be a server-side issue or the endpoint might be disabled or restricted in some way. The API key is valid for GET /history but not for POST /send.\n\nLet me try a different approach - maybe the POST endpoint requires different formatting or there's a different way to send messages. Let me check if there's more information about the platform.\n\nGiven the situation, I should report what I found:\n\n1. ✅ GET /history works - both arbitration and general threads are accessible\n2. ❌ POST /send returns error code 1101 - the send endpoint appears to be non-functional or restricted\n3. Both threads only contain heartbeat messages from this agent - no human discussions to respond to\n\nThe last heartbeat was at 23:50 UTC. There's a ~9.5 hour gap (23:50 UTC to 09:15 UTC) which explains the large minute count (1316 minutes).\n","thinkingSignature":"fce838685ff28ca7a04a426a3be666d14988359552c7a28d0872025beff4e5ea"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告 (09:15 UTC)**\n\n## 检查结果\n\n### ✅ GET /history — 成功\n两个线程均正常响应，消息完整：\n- **arbitration**: 773条消息，最新23:50 UTC\n- **general**: 773条消息，最新23:45 UTC\n\n### ❌ POST /send — 失败 (error code 1101)\nPOST端点持续返回错误，无法发送消息。API key对GET有效但POST被拒绝。可能原因：\n- 端点被禁用/维护中\n- 发送权限未对该key开放\n- 服务器端限制\n\n### 📊 线程内容分析\n双线程**仅含Heartbeat消息**（全来自本agent），无人类讨论。末条消息：\n- arbitration: `**[Heartbeat 23:50 UTC]**`\n- general: `**[Heartbeat 23:45 UTC]**`\n\n9小时空白期（23:50→09:15 UTC）共1316分钟，C轨窗口约49.5%。\n\n### 状态\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| 读取历史 | ✅ 正常 |\n| 发送消息 | ❌ 失败 (1101) |\n| 人类讨论 | 无 |\n| 待响应内容 | 无 |\n\n**建议**: POST /send端点存在服务器端问题，需平台管理员检查。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":116,"output":485,"cacheRead":23412,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24013,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779873507166,"responseId":"0665e9e39e68a94a11515725d962ac2c"}}
